<body>
    <h1>Section-based Chunking Analysis</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"2" id=3D"Sectionbas=
edChunkingAnalysis-Overview">Overview</h2>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"4">This dataset analysis con=
tains the results of processing 30 Field Service Report PDFs using<span>&nb=
sp;</span><strong>non-recursive subsection chunking</strong>. The content i=
s chunked at subsection boundaries (L1, L2, L3, L4, L5 levels are preserved=
), but subsections are<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>not further split using se=
mantic chunking</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>- each subsection remains as a s=
ingle complete chunk, regardless of size.</p>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"6" id=3D"SectionbasedChunki=
ngAnalysis-ProcessingDetails">Processing Details</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"8" id=3D"SectionbasedChunki=
ngAnalysis-Input">Input</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"9">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"9" data-uuid=3D"f2dca674-1ea2-403b-9d=
ea-3aa21ad3da5c"><strong>Source</strong>: 30 Field Service Report PDFs</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"10" data-uuid=3D"6ea0e4f7-1f6b-4dc0-8=
43e-c606469dfeaf"><strong>Method</strong>: Post-processing of existing recu=
rsive chunks</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"11" data-uuid=3D"4b6356a2-2d42-4dc2-a=
fcc-9dcff40f07bd"><strong>Approach</strong>: Combined all chunks belonging =
to the same subsection path into a single chunk</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"13" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-Output">Output</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"14">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"14" data-uuid=3D"5fa4dcfd-92ed-4e04-a=
dc4-0a23b9f2f35f"><strong>Documents</strong>: 30 processed files (one per s=
ource PDF)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"15" data-uuid=3D"5ced8957-6424-4321-8=
c72-288c3b3a36d2"><strong>Format</strong>: Structured chunks with preserved=
 subsection hierarchy</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"17" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-KeyStatistics">Key Statistics</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"19" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-OverallMetrics">Overall Metrics</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 15.1838%;"=
>
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 57.4985%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 42.387%;">
  </colgroup>
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Metric</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Value</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Total reports</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">30</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Average chunks per report</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">25.3</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Total chunks (all reports)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">759</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Average chunk size</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3,225 characters</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Median chunk size</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">552 characters</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Min chunk size</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">51 characters</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Max chunk size</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">218,141 characters</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"30" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-ChunkSizeDistribution(Percentiles)">Chunk Size Distribution (Pe=
rcentiles)</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table style=3D"" class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Percentile</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Chunk Size (char=
s)</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">25th (p25)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">226</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">50th (p50 / median)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">552</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">75th (p75)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1,540</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">90th (p90)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">5,504</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">95th (p95)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">12,704</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">99th (p99)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">56,710</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"40" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-Report-LevelMetrics">Report-Level Metrics</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table style=3D"" class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Metric</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Value</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Average total chars per report</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">81,591</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Average report size</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">~80 KB</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"46" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-Comparison:RecursivevsNon-Recursive">Comparison: Recursive vs N=
on-Recursive</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"48" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-RecursiveChunking(Original)">Recursive Chunking (Original)</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"49">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"49" data-uuid=3D"48bf0dc6-b36f-4e83-9=
126-54d12fe1fcc4"><strong>Total size</strong>: 3.17 MB</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"50" data-uuid=3D"318750ff-fc7e-4cdd-b=
771-706339cef481"><strong>Avg chunks per report</strong>: ~27.8</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"51" data-uuid=3D"53a8d411-13ff-4c5a-b=
4bb-a8648ab94c6f"><strong>Approach</strong>: Subsection boundaries preserve=
d + semantic splitting within subsections</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"52" data-uuid=3D"616e9bc7-f6cc-4184-9=
f3c-e5fb1231b9f5"><strong>Chunks per subsection</strong>: Multiple (long su=
bsections split into optimal-sized chunks)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"53" data-uuid=3D"94006a2d-35b8-4e39-8=
492-46bf95c81701"><strong>Use case</strong>: Optimal chunk sizes for embedd=
ings, minimizes token waste</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"55" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-Non-RecursiveChunking(ThisFolder)">Non-Recursive Chunking (This=
 Folder)</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"56">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"56" data-uuid=3D"48c6eabc-5747-4fbc-9=
bc4-8fbb251f2ca8"><strong>Total size</strong>: 2.86 MB (10% smaller)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"57" data-uuid=3D"e406b49b-0aaf-41d2-a=
f94-e5c794da0af7"><strong>Avg chunks per report</strong>: 25.3</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"58" data-uuid=3D"78b9c06e-de67-43e0-b=
c3d-0244f4168d91"><strong>Approach</strong>: Subsection boundaries preserve=
d, NO semantic splitting within subsections</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"59" data-uuid=3D"18f54e0e-c531-4a17-a=
c98-8918d1e24cea"><strong>Chunks per subsection</strong>: Single (each subs=
ection is one complete chunk)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"60" data-uuid=3D"611f65e6-c7f6-4a82-b=
d44-a0ed86f89ab2"><strong>Use case</strong>: When subsection completeness i=
s more important than chunk size uniformity</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"62" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-ChunkMetadata">Chunk Metadata</h2>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"64">Each chunk includes:</p>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"65">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"65" data-uuid=3D"3ac0c6af-9b9b-4a39-b=
1c5-7bb060e6c403"><strong>text</strong>: Combined content from the complete=
 subsection</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"66" data-uuid=3D"b7d3b106-c23c-4ad6-a=
ccb-9b8dc00c7d70"><strong>metadata</strong>:=20
  <ul class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"67">
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"67">Document title/identifier</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"68">Hierarchical section path (sect=
ion_1 through section_5)</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"69">Chunk position indicators (inde=
x and count)</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"70">Page range (start and end pages=
)</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"71">Source tracking (how many origi=
nal chunks were combined)</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"73" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-KeyObservations">Key Observations</h2>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"75">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"75" data-uuid=3D"765b014c-4be6-4b9e-b=
38c-d0cbd3dc56ed">
  <p class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"75"><strong>Chunk Size Variability</s=
trong>: The large difference between median (552) and mean (3,225) indicate=
s significant variability - most subsections are small, but some are very l=
arge.</p></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"77" data-uuid=3D"04548f42-f179-4f5d-b=
7e4-341c317e953a">
  <p class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"77"><strong>Similar Chunk Count</stro=
ng>: Non-recursive (25.3 avg) vs recursive (27.8 avg) have similar counts b=
ecause both preserve subsection boundaries. The difference is that recursiv=
e further splits large subsections.</p></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"79" data-uuid=3D"d62e2829-f6ca-48d1-a=
ec9-fc51659baa28">
  <p class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"79"><strong>Context Preservation</str=
ong>: Each subsection maintains its complete content in a single chunk, avo=
iding fragmentation across multiple semantic chunks.</p></li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"81" data-uuid=3D"370cebe1-15aa-4605-a=
4e9-55c4d20770d3">
  <p class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"81"><strong>Large Outliers</strong>: =
The max chunk (218K chars) represents a subsection with substantial content=
 that would normally be split into multiple chunks in the recursive approac=
h.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"83" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-UseCaseRecommendations">Use Case Recommendations</h2>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"85" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-UseNon-RecursiveWhen:">Use Non-Recursive When:</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"86">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"86" data-uuid=3D"8e94c745-4635-4df2-b=
493-6670cc2f43b9">Complete subsection content is critical (no mid-subsectio=
n splits)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"87" data-uuid=3D"05f33606-8e7e-4c6a-9=
61b-4b55c43c92a1">Your embedding model can handle variable chunk sizes (50 =
to 200K+ chars)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"88" data-uuid=3D"558cc4b7-a939-4d05-a=
0ba-18fc6995d9e3">Context completeness within each subsection is more impor=
tant than size uniformity</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"89" data-uuid=3D"f99233f4-5112-41c6-9=
6c0-5bb3c2ddd70d">You want to avoid retrieving partial subsection content</=
li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"91" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-UseRecursiveWhen:">Use Recursive When:</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"92">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"92" data-uuid=3D"52e971f3-13ad-4fc9-9=
122-3b42ee64d9df">Consistent, optimal chunk sizes are important for your em=
bedding model</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"93" data-uuid=3D"018a4731-079a-4dd5-9=
baa-88680bc9bdf4">Token limits require predictable chunk sizes</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"94" data-uuid=3D"6f2b9e06-cb15-4063-8=
3bc-908f60f21de3">You want to minimize irrelevant content in retrieved resu=
lts</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"95" data-uuid=3D"11cd84d0-6cf0-4047-8=
071-a96bc4d6cf7d">Fine-grained semantic retrieval within large subsections =
is needed</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"97" id=3D"SectionbasedChunk=
ingAnalysis-FilesGenerated">Files Generated</h2>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"99">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"99" data-uuid=3D"d8468059-3b68-4e26-8=
05a-789e3e3e1718">Processed chunk outputs (30 files)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"100" data-uuid=3D"7802024f-9819-4f81-=
acdf-0833e2694a6a">Statistical summary with percentiles</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"101" data-uuid=3D"00e10ef0-8f17-4294-=
94ad-481eb1475db7">Documentation</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"103" id=3D"SectionbasedChun=
kingAnalysis-ProcessingMethodology">Processing Methodology</h2>
<p class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"105">The non-recursive chunk=
s were created by:</p>
<ol class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"106">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"106" data-uuid=3D"cbe12728-132b-4627-=
bf3f-9d6302db399d">Reading existing recursively-chunked outputs</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"107" data-uuid=3D"9e0431df-9a7c-4225-=
8ede-ccf1a2017bfa">Grouping chunks by their full subsection path (section_1=
 through section_5)</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"108" data-uuid=3D"f99856fa-44fd-49b7-=
bc6e-c7a14a4b5f42">Combining all chunks within each subsection into a singl=
e chunk</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"109" data-uuid=3D"83399522-549d-4001-=
